# Backups of the runtime data files above. The originals are already ignored,
# but a dated copy taken before hand-editing a ledger is not covered by their
# names, so it shows up as untracked and one stray `git add -A` commits your
# funding history into a public repo.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.backup

